.TH "backlight-notify" "1" "19 November 2026" "backlight-notify 1.0.0" "User manual"

.SH NAME

backlight-notify \(em ACPI backlight notification daemon

.SH SYNOPSIS

.PP
\fBbacklight-notify\fR [\fBOPTIONS\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
\fBbacklight-notify\fR is a backlight notification daemon. It gets information from ACPI and sends notifications using libnotify.

.SH OPTIONS

.IP "\fB-h\fR, \fB--help\fR" 5
Show help options
.IP "\fB-b\fR, \fB--backlight\fR" 5
Folder name in /sys/class/backlight/<backlight> (required)
.IP "\fB-d\fR, \fB--debug\fR" 5
Enable debug information
.IP "\fB-t\fR, \fB--timeout\fR" 5
Notification timeout in seconds (-1 - default notification timeout, 0 - notification never expires)

.SH EXAMPLES

.TP
\fBbacklight-notify\fR \fB-b\fR intel_backlight
Show notifications for the \fIintel_backlight\fR device.
.TP
\fBbacklight-notify\fR \fB-b\fR intel_backlight \fB-t\fR 2
Show notifications that expire after 2 seconds.

